{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-10-12 08:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC ANNOUNCES NEW ESG TARGETS IN ITS FY21 INTEGRATED PERFORMANCE REPORT AND UNVEILS REFRESHED BRAND', 'text': 'COMPANY TO HIGHLIGHT ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) EFFORTS IN INAUGURAL ESG INVESTOR BRIEFING DUBLIN, OCT. 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT) TODAY RELEASED ITS FISCAL YEAR (FY) 2021 INTEGRATED PERFORMANCE REPORT: ENGINEERING IMPACT\xa0\xa0AND WILL SHARE KEY UPDATES AT ITS INAUGURAL ESG INVESTOR BRIEFING, TO BE HOSTED ON OCT. 13, 2021. THE COMPANY ALSO UNVEILED ITS REFRESHED BRAND WITH A NEW TAGLINE, "ENGINEERING THE EXTRAORDINARY".'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-10-11 06:45:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC HUGO™ ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY SYSTEM RECEIVES EUROPEAN CE MARK APPROVAL', 'text': 'MULTIPLE HOSPITALS ACROSS EUROPE SET TO BE THE FIRST TO INSTALL HUGO™ RAS SYSTEM AND EXPAND THE BENEFITS OF ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY TO THEIR PATIENTS DUBLIN, OCT. 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS RECEIVED CE (CONFORMITÉ EUROPÉENNE)\xa0MARK FOR THE HUGO™\xa0ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY (RAS) SYSTEM, AUTHORIZING THE SALE OF THE SYSTEM IN EUROPE. CE MARK APPROVAL IS FOR UROLOGIC AND GYNECOLOGIC PROCEDURES, WHICH MAKE UP ABOUT HALF OF ALL ROBOTIC PROCEDURES PERFORMED TODAY.'}